ility":["Host access","Runway seat"]}}],"process":[{"step":"Apply","detail":"Club, contract, track, ask, and the member roster."},{"step":"Review","detail":"PFT utility audit + member verification."},{"step":"Incubate","detail":"Mentors, quests and a league seed."},{"step":"Fund","detail":"Track pool pays out against milestones."},{"step":"Launch","detail":"Host opens, PFTs mint, the club enters the league."}],"fields":[{"id":"name","label":"Club name","group":"Club"},{"id":"ticker","label":"Ticker","group":"Club"},{"id":"track","label":"Track","group":"Club","locked":true},{"id":"chain","label":"Chain","group":"Club"},{"id":"contract","label":"Contract address","group":"Contract & mint"},{"id":"supply","label":"Supply","group":"Contract & mint"},{"id":"mint","label":"Mint price","group":"Contract & mint"},{"id":"ask","label":"Ask (USDC)","group":"Funding"},{"id":"raised","label":"Raised to date","group":"Funding","locked":true},{"id":"treasury","label":"Treasury wallet","group":"Funding"},{"id":"world","label":"World","group":"World"},{"id":"host","label":"Host","group":"World"},{"id":"launch","label":"Launch window","group":"World"},{"id":"putsMinted","label":"PFTs minted","group":"PFTs · Profile Fungible Tokens"},{"id":"putUtility","label":"PFT utility","group":"PFTs · Profile Fungible Tokens"},{"id":"eggpaper","label":"EggPaper link","group":"Papers","locked":true}],"papers":[{"id":"eggpaper","slug":"eggpaper","title":"EggPaper","sub":"Whitepaper: the club, its world and how it hatches","file":"EggPaper-v1.pdf","required":true},{"id":"puts","slug":"puts","title":"PFTs paper","sub":"Profile Fungible Tokens: what each token unlocks and who holds them","file":"PFTs-v1.pdf","required":true},{"id":"deck","slug":"deck","title":"Pitch deck","sub":"Ten slides for the review panel","file":"Deck.pdf","required":false},{"id":"roadmap","slug":"roadmap","title":"Roadmap","sub":"Milestones the track pool pays out against","file":"Roadmap.pdf","required":false}],"frameworks":[{"id":"founder","kicker":"For founders","title":"Envision. Create. Unleash.","steps":[{"word":"Envision","tone":"accent","body":"Picture the club before it exists: the world, the first look, the people who will wear it. Write it down as your EggPaper.","maps":["Apply","Review"]},{"word":"Create","tone":"sage","body":"Build with mentors and a track pool behind you. Design the garments, the city and the PFT utility your members will earn.","maps":["Incubate","Fund"]},{"word":"Unleash","tone":"ink","body":"Open the host, mint the PFTs and walk the first show. Your club enters the league the same day.","maps":["Launch"]}]},{"id":"holder","kicker":"For members","title":"Dream. Design. Delight.","steps":[{"word":"Dream","tone":"neutral","body":"Every club starts with a world worth visiting. Members arrive for the dream and stay for the people in it.","maps":["Worlds","Shows"]},{"word":"Design","tone":"accent","body":"Looks, garments and cities are designed with the members, not for them. Every create earns PFTs.","maps":["Creates","PFTs"]},{"word":"Delight","tone":"sage","body":"Runways, quests and drops keep the world alive. Delight is what the league measures.","maps":["Quests","League"]}]}],"library":[{"id":"lib_eggpaper","slug":"eggpaper","title":"The EggPaper","sub":"Phiegg’s whitepaper: how clubs hatch worlds, and why","tone":"accent","version":"v1.0 · Sep 2026","sections":[{"h":"Abstract","body":"Phiegg is a home for fashion clubs that build worlds. A club opens a host for its community, a world for its members to walk around in, and a runway for its looks. Phipad is the accelerator that funds the ones that need it."},{"h":"Dream","body":"A club is a promise of a place. Before anything is minted, the founders describe the world: its cities, its weather, its dress code, the kind of evening you would have there.","list":["Worlds are virtual, AR or agentic","Every world has cities members can nest in","Agents live in worlds and host them when founders sleep"]},{"h":"Design","body":"Members design alongside the club. Looks, garments and venues are created in the open and credited on the creator’s profile with Profile Fungible Tokens.","list":["Garments carry the club’s mark","Creates earn PFTs","PFT utility is written into the club’s EggPaper"]},{"h":"Delight","body":"A world that nobody visits is a render. Shows, drops, quests and parties give members a reason to come back, and the league turns that energy into a season.","list":["Weekly runways per world","Sponsored quests with coin rewards","A 64-club league scored on engagement, sales, drops, utility, creates and quests"]},{"h":"The economy","body":"Clubs have coins, members stake them in pools, quests pay them out. PFTs sit beside the coins and are not speculative: they cannot be bought, only earned. 100 trillion are set aside so every dream counts."},{"h":"Phipad","body":"Four funding tracks share one review process. Clubs apply with their EggPaper, their PFTs paper and their team; the track pool pays out against milestones."}]},{"id":"lib_puts101","slug":"pfts-101","title":"PFTs 101","sub":"Profile Fungible Tokens in five minutes","tone":"sage","version":"v1.0 · Sep 2026","sections":[{"h":"Your utility. Your value.","body":"A Profile Fungible Token is a credential minted to your Phiegg profile. It says what you did for a club and unlocks what the club offers in return. It works for you."},{"h":"Not speculation. Utility.","body":"PFTs are bought to be sold on. PFTs are earned to be used. Your club PFT stays in your wallet and can move; the PFTs you earn with it stay on your profile and keep working for you.","list":["PFT utility is exercised through your profile","Earned PFTs cannot be sold or transferred","They stack: more PFTs, more utility","Leave a club and its earned PFTs are burned"]},{"h":"100T PFTs. Every dream counts.","body":"100 trillion PFTs are set aside for every club, creator and member who ever hatches on Phiegg. There is room for every dream, grand or small. All you need is the dream."},{"h":"How you earn one","body":"","list":["Create a look, garment or venue for a club","Finish a quest or a drop","Host a nest, a show or a party","Join a founding team on Phipad"]},{"h":"What it unlocks","body":"Each club writes its own utility. The common ones:","list":["Host access and member-only nests","A seat at the runway","AR wearables you can try on","Quest multipliers","Fitting credits with the club’s agents"]},{"h":"Making value. Making sense.","body":"For clubs: design utility people use weekly, not once. Tie every PFT to a real action and publish the rules in your PFTs paper, so members know what they are earning and why."},{"h":"Quick answers","body":"","list":["Do PFTs cost anything? No.","Can I lose them? Only by leaving the club.","Do agents earn PFTs? Agents can award them, not hold them.","Where do I see mine? Your profile, under Clubs."]}]},{"id":"lib_playbook","slug":"founders-playbook","title":"Founder’s playbook","sub":"Envision, create, unleash: the Phipad route step by step","tone":"ink","version":"v1.0 · Sep 2026","sections":[{"h":"Envision","body":"Write your EggPaper. Name the world, the first collection and the members you are building for. Pick a track and set an ask you can defend.","list":["EggPaper (required)","PFTs paper (required)","Team roster with roles"]},{"h":"Create","body":"Incubation pairs you with mentors and a quest. Build the first city, the first garments and the PFT utility. Milestones unlock the pool.","list":["Pitch deck for the review panel","Roadmap with milestones","One live quest before launch"]},{"h":"Unleash","body":"Open your host, mint PFTs to the team and walk the first show. The club is seeded into the league and the season starts.","list":["Host opens","PFTs mint","League seed assigned"]}]},{"id":"lib_tracks","slug":"track-guide","title":"Track guide","sub":"The four Phipad pools and what each one funds","tone":"neutral","version":"v1.0 · Sep 2026","sections":[]}],"puts":{"headline":"100T PFTs. Every dream counts.","body":"PFTs are not speculative collectibles. Nobody buys them to flip them. They are earned, they live on your profile, and they run functions for you: access, create, host, quest, vote and fund. Phisum reads what they do.","supply":"100,000,000,000,000"},"stats":[{"label":"Funds deployed","value":"6.4M USDC","sub":"across 4 tracks"},{"label":"Clubs funded","value":"38","sub":"of 260 applied"},{"label":"Launched","value":"21","sub":"live on Phiegg"},{"label":"Median time to launch","value":"11 wks","sub":"apply → launch"}],"steps":[{"n":1,"title":"Apply","body":"Submit your club, team and the world you want to build. Pick a track."},{"n":2,"title":"Review","body":"Mentors score each application weekly. Shortlisted teams get a call."},{"n":3,"title":"Incubate","body":"Four to eight weeks with mentors, a Phinux build budget and runway slots."},{"n":4,"title":"Fund","body":"Track pool commits capital against milestones, released as you hit them."},{"n":5,"title":"Launch","body":"Open your host on Phiegg with a guaranteed drop slot and capture support."}],"news":[{"id":"pn5","date":"Oct 2, 2026","tag":"Cohort","title":"Autumn cohort: 9 clubs selected","body":"Nine clubs move into incubation this week across the virtual-worlds and agentic tracks, the largest single intake since Phipad opened."},{"id":"pn4","date":"Sep 24, 2026","tag":"Track","title":"Agentic worlds pool doubles to 1M USDC","body":"Backed by a Phidao season grant, the agentic track pool doubles for applications building worlds populated by autonomous agent citizens."},{"id":"pn3","date":"Sep 12, 2026","tag":"Launch","title":"Swan launches on Phiegg","body":"PFP-and-authenticity alum Swan opened its host with a sold-out first drop, the fourth Phipad club to launch this quarter."},{"id":"pn2","date":"Aug 30, 2026","tag":"Programme","title":"Mentor network grows to 24","body":"Founders, designers and treasury leads from launched clubs join the mentor roster for the autumn cohort."},{"id":"pn1","date":"Aug 15, 2026","tag":"Cohort","title":"Applications open for the autumn cohort","body":"Rolling applications are open across all four tracks. Review happens weekly; there is no single deadline."}],"about":{"body":"Phipad is the accelerator for clubs building worlds. Take the Phipad route when you need cash, mentors and a launch slot — or go straight to Phiegg if you are already funded. The platform is the same either way.","sections":[{"title":"What we fund","body":"Clubs building a world: AR wearables, virtual cities, agentic worlds, and PFP projects with provable ownership. Four tracks, each with its own pool and mentors."},{"title":"How funding works","body":"Track pools commit against milestones, not all at once. Capital releases as you hit agreed targets through incubation, so the risk is shared and the runway is real."},{"title":"What you get","body":"Mentors from launched clubs, a Phinux build budget, runway and capture slots, and a guaranteed launch slot on Phiegg with a drop."},{"title":"The direct route","body":"Already funded elsewhere? Verify your contract, open a host and list your world today — no cohort required."}]},"faq":[{"q":"Who can apply?","a":"Any club with a team and a world to build. You do not need to be funded or incorporated — a clear plan and a track that fits is enough."},{"q":"Is there a deadline?","a":"No. Applications are rolling and reviewed weekly. Cohorts form as enough clubs in a track are ready."},{"q":"How much can we raise?","a":"Asks typically run 90,000–400,000 USDC depending on track and scope. Capital releases against milestones."},{"q":"What do you take?","a":"Phipad takes a small share of the club's token supply, aligned with holders and vested over the launch."},{"q":"Do we have to launch on Phiegg?","a":"Funded clubs launch on Phiegg to use the shared hosts, drops and wallet. The direct route is for clubs that only need to verify and open a host."}]}